  <widget type="label" version="2.0.0">
    <name>EDM activeXTextClass</name>
    <text>1. Is there a red box on the RF Controller tab? 
     Re-run Pulsed SEL Cal
2. WF decimation should be 255 
     (shortcut at bottom of unit test EDM)
3. Check the detune in SELA at 10-16MV with fb in manual and 
     offset=0. Turn fb back on after zeroing.
4. Check amp &amp; phas fbck gains: -2000/-200 or -200/-20 are 
     good places to start.
5. Check Reactive Power Fraction - needs to be &gt;0 for SELAP
6. Check Amp/Phas Diag page for overrange
7. Check SEL phase offset - minimize FWD power in SELA or 
     straightent the cheeto in SELAP
8. If amplitude isn't regulating, try re-calibrating the SSA
     and re-doing cavity cdharacterization.</text>
    <x>12</x>
    <y>24</y>
    <width>340</width>
    <height>232</height>
    <font>
      <font family="Liberation Sans" style="REGULAR" size="12.0">
      </font>
    </font>
    <foreground_color>
